# asof-wiki:gitignore (modified for examples)
#
# In a real Pattern C wiki you'd ignore .asof/raw/ + .asof/.last-sync/ since
# they're regenerable working state. For the example wikis we INCLUDE raw/
# in the commit so CI can lint them from a fresh checkout (path-mismatch
# would fire if raw files weren't there).
#
# When you copy this example into your own repo, restore the standard
# .gitignore by uncommenting the asof working-state lines below.

# .asof/raw/                 # uncomment in your own repo
.asof/.last-sync/
.asof/.pending-sync/
.asof/.asof.lock
.asof/wiki.bak.*/
# /asof-wiki:gitignore
